{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It\u2019s moving day! Start by cleaning up each house, removing trash and getting rooms ready for a fresh start. Then unpack boxes filled with random furniture and decor, moving items between rooms and placing them on floors, walls, or furniture with smooth drag-and-drop. Gentle client requests add playful challenges, while every piece you place unlocks new items for Sandbox mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with small cozy homes and progress to larger houses with guestrooms, game rooms, gyms, and more. When you\u2019re done, use Camera Mode to capture your designs - adjust angles, lighting, and backgrounds to share your creations in the perfect light. Cozy, replayable, and pressure-free, Moving Day makes every move a new story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate rooms </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986710/extras/75c289f722637b8c198fa7790fcfd956.poster.avif?t=1774629499\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986710/extras/75c289f722637b8c198fa7790fcfd956.webm?t=1774629499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986710/extras/75c289f722637b8c198fa7790fcfd956.mp4?t=1774629499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986710/extras/0ec1cd121cca87d5d1c120116a993bd5.poster.avif?t=1774629499\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986710/extras/0ec1cd121cca87d5d1c120116a993bd5.webm?t=1774629499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src